        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA geaghus niny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Leendeeda sibwat sanaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga sina sanaamu ak gawuurji gidamwadaagha, nea haleanjeeda nyaawa bwariiy saawa ea mayghwaloat gil, ak eara muushoodiga nyaawa ea mwadaaha gil, nea mwanala gil ak gajeepwaaspwaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siisi ng'eaha gil sin sanaamuun, ada abeeda gwasin sanaamooda was gidamwadaagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, fugaagu iduupcheewi sean gajeapwaaspwaas, ea gearnoodiga nea saawa ea buuneeda gil, asi dabwadageat saawa aba hijagi, ak gayghamiinaada ak ghang'ut giyoonda ak gajeapwaaspwaas sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida adeang'shachi gaygageanu gharinyeanda ak ghaghwar, amang'ata ghwaadaay sanaaamu. Ak gagulgul aba yundu ghwanung' ghwadaamdaam nea gwasin aba uurda geatindaanyi inyeesa ghwayeat jih nea gabur ak ghwaak muwooshta nea goosha uurda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara siida foora beehajeega inyeesa goodeen beehiida. Amang'ata gooroor aba galaamoadaanyi, ak gwasin aba dabitaanyi giduurji siida bwak ea ghamiidu ratoadaanyi, ak gageanu sanaamoodida sibada ak ghwayiin hichpa geaw heechea goobiida aba jeeda gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida gayghwalach gubooyeanda jea gagadiyeata ak ghwaloat geeta siguura beroshi ghana sawacheanda, ak ghwanung'waada gwaheedu aba jeeda geediga dimda. Ak ghang'aapta gubooyeanda ak gooheedu roopta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geedi gayghoah ghweendooda aba heedeaba siisi, nea gwaju siida beastaanyi, nea ghoawaala mukaateeydaanyi. Ak gageanu gwasin sanaamu ak ghabwat, amang'ata gageanu gwasin sanaamu ak ghabwat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu gidanung' googween iyeenya ak ghaghwarda aba beasta, nea gidagween iyeenya nuut ghwaak banyeega, ak ghabeash banyeega ak ghwaak ea gwalang'u, ama ng'ata gwaju beasta nea gwayi, “Geajooyi beasta ak ea naadaayi beasta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heeda abit bea geetida gageanu gwasin sanaamooda sibada, ak gwatkung'usa aba madeadaanyi ak ghabwat, ak ghamwaash nea gwayeesha, “Weadaan aba gideaba ang'iing'i guwoosi aseeteanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu mwanala gil ak ea maygwajeeng'u gil, aba gideaba sidukuta gheanyanga nyaawa, eara fughareenga nyaawa ea mwanala gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea manda siida ateemsheesa ng'asheanji ghana dea mideawa fughareeda, ak gooteemshi nea gwayi, “Gidagween iyeenya bea geedi ak geasinyi mukaate aba badayda ghuurga ghaaghwari beasta ak ghaabeashi banyeega ak ghaayaaji. Heapi dea abit gaydasin sanaamu sibada mwahida, ak ghaaghadoawanyi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giiteemshoadaanyi gweateay sea gil was deareedean. Siisi abeeda niroat mayghoamu ghaweat geaw nea gabwageaw ak gwayi, “Aba huumwa gili aang'oanyi geatindean reengaweega beachi gil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'utamiida gwasin haleanjeeda sean ak ea lealnoocheanda gil",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
